ZLLMakeup for WebCLAP (ports/zl-lmakeup), all under ZL_WEBCLAP:

- PluginProcessor.cpp: ZL_WEBCLAP_HEADLESS builds the processor without its editor (module.wasm)
- controller.cpp: a block without a transport has no position (upstream dereferences the empty position)
- Panel/logo_panel.cpp, PluginEditor.h: one style, the default (dark), whatever ui_style holds; a double click on the
  logo no longer switches it, and the editor no longer listens to ui_style
- PluginEditor.cpp: not resizable, no resize corner (the page shows the editor at its size)

